1601724,Gazic,Edin,Edin Gazic,gazic,1979-09-13,F,F,31,Er verstarb am 30. März 2001.

Rumours say that Edin Gazic died on a cocain overdose. He was known as one of the greatest talents in Swiss football, he played for Grasshopper youth teams. But the darkside of his life were car accidents, cocain consumption (Grasshopper fired him, after he failed an internal drug test) and presumed criminal activity. In 2000 he dissappeared. On March 30, 2001 Zurich police found his dead body in his appartment. Questions were raised. Was Swiss football guilty? Didn not coaches and managers give him the help he needed? Are 12.000 SFr. per month too much for a teenager?,2005-07-26,2005-08-10,1015,,1601724,0, ,5850
